{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0203","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:00000114:text","row":29562,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"部室。","en":"The clubroom.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800385","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00001","en":"The club room.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:00000132:text","row":29563,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴がいるかと思ったが、無人だった。","en":"I expected to find Tomoki there, but the room was empty.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800386","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00002","en":"I was wondering whether Tomoki was here, but it was deserted.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:0000016e:text","row":29564,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"きっと『部活』に精を出しているのだろう。","en":"He must have been hard at work on his ‘club activities.’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800387","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00003","en":"He's working hard at his 'club', I'm sure.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:000001ae:text","row":29565,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"となれば、今頃は町中か。","en":"In that case, he was probably somewhere in town by now.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800388","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00004","en":"And if he is, right now he'd be downtown.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:000001e6:text","row":29566,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……静かだな」","en":"“...It's quiet.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800389","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00005","en":"Taichi: \"...quiet, innit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:0000020e:text","row":29567,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"一人になると、わかる。","en":"Only when I was alone did I notice.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800390","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00006","en":"When I am alone I understand.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:0000023c:text","row":29568,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"人がいないだけで、こうも静まるものか。","en":"Could the absence of people make a place this quiet?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800391","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00007","en":"Do things not quiet down this much only when there are no people?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:0000027a:text","row":29569,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"雰囲気が透けて、空間が広く感じられた。","en":"The atmosphere itself seemed to thin, and the room felt larger.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800392","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00008","en":"The atmosphere goes transparent, the space gives the impression of vastness.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:000002b8:text","row":29570,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"静穏。","en":"Stillness.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800393","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00009","en":"Serenity.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0203:000002d6:text","row":29571,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"雑踏は永遠に失われている。","en":"The bustle was gone forever.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800394","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029c:00010","en":"The bustle of crowds lost for all eternity.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
